          "(A) the expenditures must be treated as domestic research or experimental expenditures under section 174A (before Pub. L. 119-21 this referred to <a href=\"/us/glossary/specified-research-or-experimental-expenditures-sre\">specified research or experimental expenditures</a> under section 174);",
          "(B) the research must be undertaken to discover information that is technological in nature and intended to be useful in developing a new or improved business component;",
          "(C) substantially all of the activities must constitute elements of a process of experimentation for a <a href=\"/us/legislation/26-usc-41d3-qualified-research-permitted-purposes\">permitted purpose</a>; and",
