          "<strong>Generalist QRE Calculation</strong>: Conversely, if a generalist accountant misses 37.5% of eligible expenditures by failing to capture factory-floor process engineering and iterative wash trials—consistent with the ratio between the $45,000 generalist average and $72,000 specialist average ($45,000 / $72,000 = 0.625, or 62.5% captured; $27,000 / $72,000 = 0.375, or 37.5% missed)—each category is reduced to 62.5% of its full eligible value:",
