    "title": "Best software for tracking R&D time and expenses",
    "description": "The best software for tracking R&D time and expenses links employee hours, project codes, and W-2 labor rates to qualified research under 26 U.S.C. § 41.",
    "summary": "The best software for tracking R&D time and expenses links employee hours, project codes, and W-2 labor rates to qualified research under 26 U.S.C. § 41. U.S. businesses claiming the federal R&D tax credit can use Deltek Replicon, TimeControl, ClickTime, My Hours, innoscripta Clusterix, or native tools like Jira, provided records reconcile timesheets, payroll, and project data.",
    "language": "en-US",
