          "<strong>Forensic Accounting and Invoice Scrubbing:</strong> Reviewing vendor invoices line by line to remove capital expenditures, depreciable property, travel, and administrative overhead before applying the 65% inclusion rate under <a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/26/41\">26 U.S.C. § 41(b)(3)(A)</a>."
