        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "In Australia, the business.gov.au guidance asks claimants to keep records showing how they determined the outcome was unknown, and records of each step of the systematic progression of work: hypothesis, experiment, observation, evaluation and logical conclusions. Examples it gives include records of trial runs and test reports with results and analysis."
