              "Form W-2 taxable wages paid for <a href=\"/us/glossary/qualified-services\">qualified services</a>: direct conduct, direct supervision, or direct support of qualified research.",
              "Excludes non-taxable fringe benefits, general executive management, and <a href=\"/us/glossary/general-and-administrative-functions\">administrative overhead</a>.",
              "Payroll registers, Forms W-2, contemporaneous <a href=\"/us/faq/how-to-track-rd-hours-for-tax-credits\">time-tracking logs</a>, and project allocation schedules."
