        "text": "Passing the mandatory Six-Eye Review is an absolute prerequisite for a claim to qualify for creditARMOR enrollment. Once integrated, the platform operates through two complementary mechanisms that combine automated computational review with financial risk mitigation. First, through <a href=\"/us/faq/ai-rd-tax-credit-platforms\">AI-driven pre-audit scanning</a> powered by Natural Language Processing (NLP) and regulatory audit-risk heuristics across the TaxTrex and creditARMOR architecture, the software evaluates draft project narratives prior to submission to flag potentially noncompliant terminology, weak experimentation nexus, or substantiation gaps, while providing \"Intelligent Response Guidance\" to structure technical rebuttals if an administrative inquiry arises. Second, through audit defense risk transfer, creditARMOR pairs pre-filing technical vetting with financial coverage for <a href=\"/us/faq/rd-tax-credit-audit-defense-cost\">professional audit defense expenses</a>—including CPA, engineering, and specialist legal representation fees—in the event a vetted R&D tax credit claim is selected for examination by a tax authority."
