        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Score<sub>Mill</sub> = Clamp<sub>0</sub><sup>100</sup> (50 + 20(0) − 25(2)) = Clamp<sub>0</sub><sup>100</sup>(50 − 50) = 0 (High Risk Tier)"
