        "text": "Third, <strong>Computer Rental / <a href=\"/us/faq/aws-cloud-hosting-costs-rd-tax-credit\">Cloud Computing for R&D</a> (26 U.S.C. § 41(b)(2)(A)(iii); 26 CFR § 1.41-2(b)(4))</strong> covers amounts paid to another person for the right to use off-premises, non-taxpayer-owned computers (such as cloud-based fermentation kinetics modeling, batch-yield sensor analytics, or shelf-life modeling platforms) in the conduct of qualified research."
