        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Breweries and distilleries must comply with two distinct tiers of upfront IRS reporting depending on whether the claim is filed on an original return or an <a href=\"/us/glossary/amended-tax-return-rd-credit\">amended return</a> (refund claim)."
