        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "To build an audit-resilient technical record that satisfies both the Siemer Milling scientific experimentation standard and Form 6765 Section G <a href=\"/us/glossary/project-accounting\">project accounting</a>, brewery and distillery management should implement three operational controls:"
