        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "In the baseline hypothetical scenario defined in the source script (where the base claim rate state parameter is set to 0.10), an enterprise incurs an estimated qualifying R&D expenditure of <em>E</em> = $500,000 at an assumed effective base tax credit rate of <em>r</em> = 10% (0.10), yielding a gross unadjusted tax credit (<em>C</em><sub>gross</sub>) of $50,000:"
