        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Because evaluating dental R&D requires separating clinical skill from materials science, biomedical engineering, and computer science, a purely accounting-driven review is insufficient to substantiate a claim under IRC § 41. Positioning itself as \"one of the most, if not, the most conservative R&D tax providers in the market,\" the firm codifies its compliance controls through three institutional mechanisms."
