        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "TCJA Section 174(b) defined \"specified research or experimental expenditures\" as research or experimental expenditures (within the meaning of Treasury Regulation Section 1.174-2) that are paid or incurred by the taxpayer during the taxable year in connection with the taxpayer's trade or business. The scope of capitalization for the 2024 tax year encompassed several critical statutory and administrative rules:"
