          "<strong>Exhaustive cost categories vs. excluded overhead.</strong> In Notice 2023-63, Section 4.03(1), the IRS provided an exhaustive list of cost categories that must be capitalized as SRE expenditures when paid or incurred in the performance of SRE activities or in the <a href=\"/us/glossary/direct-support\">direct support</a> of SRE activities:",
