              "Narrow: limited strictly to in-house wages for <a href=\"/us/glossary/qualified-services\">qualified services</a>, supplies used in qualified research, amounts paid or incurred for the right to use computers in qualified research, and 65% (or 75%/100% for specific consortia/energy research) of contract research expenses (§ 41(b))."
