        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The IRS comprehensively redesigned <strong>Form 6765 (Credit for Increasing Research Activities)</strong> beginning with the December 2024 revision and further updated in the December 2025 revision and IRS News Release IR-2025-99 (issued October 1, 2025)."
