          "<strong>Small QRE Filers on Original Returns:</strong> Taxpayers with total qualified research expenses of <strong>$1,500,000 or less</strong> (determined at the <a href=\"/us/glossary/controlled-group\">controlled-group</a> level) <strong>and</strong> gross receipts of <strong>$50,000,000 or less</strong> (determined under § 448(c)(3) at the controlled-group level), provided they are claiming the research credit on a timely filed <strong>original</strong> return.",
