        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Under IRC §41(h)(3)(A) and IRS Notice 2017-23 (2017-16 I.R.B. 1100), a corporation (including an S corporation) or a partnership is a <a href=\"/us/glossary/qualified-small-business-qsb\">qualified small business (QSB)</a> with respect to any tax year if both of the following statutory conditions are satisfied:"
