              "IRM 4.1.2 (DIF Scoring, Activity Codes 203–217 & LB&I Codes 219–230); IRM 4.22.1 (NRP Baselines); IRS Pub. 1500; I.R.C. § 41(c)(5) (formerly § 41(c)(6), Consistency Rule).",
