              "I.R.C. § 41(d)(3)(B) & § 41(d)(4)(A)–(H); 26 C.F.R. § 1.41-4(c)(2); 26 C.F.R. §§ 1.41-2(e) & 1.41-4A(d); <em>United States v. Grigsby</em>, 86 F.4th 602 (5th Cir. 2023); <em>Smith v. Commissioner</em>, T.C. Memo. 2026-50.",
