        "text": "To illustrate the exact mathematical application of 26 U.S.C. § 41(c)(3) and its <a href=\"/us/faq/irs-form-6765-instructions-2024\">reporting mechanics on IRS Form 6765</a> (<em>Credit for Increasing Research Activities</em>), consider a hypothetical domestic technology firm, TechNova Corporation, which has conducted continuous research since 1982 and therefore computes its Fixed-Base Percentage as an established taxpayer under Section 41(c)(3)(A)."
