        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Assume that TechNova Corporation's contemporaneous financial ledgers from the 1984–1988 base period substantiate aggregate QREs (QRE<sub>1984–1988</sub>) of $4,000,000 (determined on a basis consistent with current-year QRE accounting under the Consistency Rule) and aggregate gross receipts (GR<sub>1984–1988</sub>) of $50,000,000. During the current taxable year, TechNova incurs $2,000,000 in QREs (QRE<sub>current</sub>, reported on Form 6765, Line 9), and its annual gross receipts, net of returns and allowances under Treas. Reg. § 1.41-3(c), for the four immediately preceding taxable years (GR<sub>t−4</sub>, GR<sub>t−3</sub>, GR<sub>t−2</sub>, GR<sub>t−1</sub>) were $13,000,000, $14,500,000, $15,500,000, and $17,000,000, respectively."
