        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Because 50 percent of AeroCode AI LLC's $0 Georgia income tax liability is $0, the entire $70,000 excess credit reported on Form IT-RD is elected on Form IT-WH via the Georgia Tax Center to immediately offset Georgia state employee payroll withholding taxes under O.C.G.A. § 48-7-103. Together with the $180,000 <a href=\"/us/faq/startup-rd-payroll-tax-offset\">federal Section 41(h) offset</a>, AeroCode AI LLC realizes <strong>$250,000</strong> in near-term payroll and withholding tax relief."
